---
// Discord's slow channel: a delete is a tombstone write, and a read must step over
// every tombstone still on disk to reach the one live message.
// Plain inline SVG with site tokens, polygon arrowheads, no ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
const W = 900;
const H = 410;
const step = 30;
const before = Array.from({ length: 24 }, (_, i) => i === 23);
const after = [false, false, false, true];
---
<figure class="ts">
  <div class="ts-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="A Cassandra read of one Discord channel. Before the fix, millions of deleted-message tombstones sit in front of the one live message, so the read steps over every tombstone and the channel takes 20 seconds to load. After tombstones are kept 2 days instead of 10, compaction drops them sooner and the same read crosses only a few.">
    <text x="20" y="24" class="ts-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One channel, one live message</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một kênh, một tin nhắn còn sống</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="46" class="ts-sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Deleting a message writes a tombstone. A read has to step over every tombstone still on disk.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Xoá một tin nhắn là ghi một tombstone. Lệnh đọc phải bước qua mọi tombstone còn nằm trên đĩa.</tspan>
    </text>

    <DiagramIcon name="cassandra" x={32} y={79} size={24} />
    <text x="56" y="84" class="ts-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Before: tombstones kept 10 days</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Trước: tombstone giữ 10 ngày</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x={W - 20} y="84" text-anchor="end" class="ts-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>drawn as 23 dead cells; in the real channel, millions</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>vẽ 23 ô đã xoá; kênh thật có hàng triệu</tspan>
    </text>
    {before.map((live, i) => (
      <rect x={20 + i * step} y="98" width="26" height="30" rx="3" class={live ? 'ts-cell is-hit' : 'ts-cell is-dead'} />
    ))}
    <path d={`M20,146 L${20 + 24 * step - 12},146`} class="ts-arrow" /><polygon points={`${20 + 24 * step - 12},141 ${20 + 24 * step - 12},151 ${20 + 24 * step - 4},146`} class="ts-head" />
    <text x="20" y="170" class="ts-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Cassandra steps over every tombstone to reach the live message</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Cassandra bước qua từng tombstone mới tới được tin nhắn còn sống</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="826" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="ts-big">
      <tspan data-lang-en>20 s</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>20 giây</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="826" y="138" text-anchor="middle" class="ts-note is-hit">
      <tspan data-lang-en>to load</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>để tải</tspan>
    </text>

    <line x1="20" x2={W - 20} y1="196" y2="196" class="ts-rule" />

    <DiagramIcon name="cassandra" x={32} y={221} size={24} />
    <text x="56" y="226" class="ts-in-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>After: tombstones kept 2 days</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Sau: tombstone giữ 2 ngày</tspan>
    </text>
    {after.map((live, i) => (
      <rect x={20 + i * step} y="240" width="26" height="30" rx="3" class={live ? 'ts-cell is-hit' : 'ts-cell is-dead'} />
    ))}
    <path d={`M20,288 L${20 + 4 * step - 12},288`} class="ts-arrow" /><polygon points={`${20 + 4 * step - 12},283 ${20 + 4 * step - 12},293 ${20 + 4 * step - 4},288`} class="ts-head" />
    <text x="20" y="312" class="ts-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Compaction drops tombstones older than 2 days, so the scan stays short</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Compaction bỏ tombstone cũ hơn 2 ngày, nên lượt quét ngắn lại</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="346" width="26" height="22" rx="3" class="ts-cell is-dead" />
    <text x="56" y="362" class="ts-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>tombstone (deleted message)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tombstone (tin nhắn đã xoá)</tspan>
    </text>
    <rect x="360" y="346" width="26" height="22" rx="3" class="ts-cell is-hit" />
    <text x="396" y="362" class="ts-in-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>the one message still in the channel</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>tin nhắn duy nhất còn lại trong kênh</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="20" y="394" class="ts-note">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Discord could shorten the lifespan to 2 days because it repairs the message cluster every night.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Discord rút ngắn xuống 2 ngày được vì họ chạy repair cho cụm tin nhắn mỗi đêm.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Why one channel took 20 seconds to load in Discord's 2017 Cassandra cluster, simplified from the engineering post. Real tombstones are spread over several files; the cells only show how many a read has to cross.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Vì sao một kênh mất 20 giây để tải trong cụm Cassandra của Discord năm 2017, giản lược từ bài kỹ thuật của họ. Tombstone thật nằm rải trên nhiều file; các ô chỉ cho thấy một lệnh đọc phải đi qua bao nhiêu cái.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ts { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .ts-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .ts svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .ts text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .ts .ts-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ts .ts-sub, .ts .ts-zone { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ts .ts-zone { font-size: 13px; }
  .ts-divider { stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 6 5; }
  .ts-rule { stroke: var(--border); }
  .ts-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ts-box.is-hot, .ts-box.is-hit { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ts-cell { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .ts-cell.is-hit { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .ts-cell.is-dead { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-dasharray: 3 3; }
  .ts .ts-in { font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .ts .ts-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .ts .ts-in-m { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .ts .ts-in-s { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .ts .ts-mono { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .ts .ts-mono.is-hit { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .ts .ts-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ts .ts-note.is-hit { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .ts-arrow { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .ts-arrow.is-hit { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .ts-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .ts-head.is-hit { fill: var(--red); }
  .ts figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
  .ts .ts-big { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--red); }
</style>
